CRITERION (pre-stated, mechanical): for each of the four flags
  avx512f avx512vl vaes vpclmulqdq
grep the lscpu Flags line; record grep's exit status (0=present, 1=absent).
This script exits 0 iff lscpu ran and all four were tested; it does NOT
exit nonzero for an absent flag -- absence is a recorded fact, not a failure.
Item 17 gating rule: the VAES lane is measurable IFF vaes==present AND
vpclmulqdq==present.

lscpu exit=0
--- model ---
Architecture:                            x86_64
CPU(s):                                  4
Model name:                              Intel(R) Xeon(R) Processor @ 2.80GHz
Thread(s) per core:                      1
--- per-flag grep exit codes ---
  avx512f      grep_exit=0  PRESENT
  avx512vl     grep_exit=0  PRESENT
  vaes         grep_exit=1  ABSENT
  vpclmulqdq   grep_exit=1  ABSENT
--- full AVX-512 family present ---
avx512_vnni avx512bw avx512cd avx512dq avx512f avx512vl 

ITEM17_VAES_LANE=ENVIRONMENT_IMPOSSIBLE (vaes_exit=1 vpclmulqdq_exit=1)
